flowchart TB
  FILES[Local source files] --> UP[POST /api/uploads]
  UP --> DISC[DiscoveryRunner<br/>detect, parse, inventory, dependencies]
  DISC --> EST[POST /api/convert/estimate]
  EST --> CONSENT{User explicitly consents<br/>to send selected code to Devin?}
  CONSENT -- No --> STOP[No conversion sessions are started]
  CONSENT -- Yes --> START[POST /api/convert<br/>consent=true, optional object_ids]
  START --> BATCH[Plan dependency-aware batches]
  BATCH --> CONTEXT[Build context for all objects in this batch<br/>KB retrieval, mappings, rules, dependencies]
  CONTEXT --> A[Voter A session]
  CONTEXT --> B[Voter B session]
  CONTEXT --> C[Voter C session]
  A & B & C --> OBJECTS[Collect candidates per object]
  OBJECTS --> VOTE[Consensus, validation checks,<br/>confidence score per object]
  VOTE --> LOW{Any object below threshold<br/>or needing escalation?}
  LOW -- No --> FINAL[Finalize each object<br/>converted, expert_review, or failed]
  LOW -- Yes --> ESC[One escalation session for the batch's<br/>low-confidence objects]
  ESC --> RECHECK[Re-validate and re-score<br/>each revised object]
  RECHECK --> FINAL
  FINAL --> MORE{More batches?}
  MORE -- Yes --> BATCH
  MORE -- No --> DONE[Conversion job results]
  BATCH -. user may cancel active job .-> CANCEL["POST /api/convert/jobs/{job_id}/cancel"]
  CANCEL --> DONE
  DONE --> SELECTED[Optional selected re-convert:<br/>POST /api/convert with object_ids<br/>new job merges into the base run in memory]
  DONE --> DOWNLOAD[GET /api/download<br/>GET /api/report.md or /api/report.pdf]
